        {
          "id": "build",
          "catalogue": "Map",
          "values": {
            "items": [
              "\\textbf{1. The theorem.}\\\\ Let $K$ be a compact subset of $\\mathbb{R}$ and let $f:K\\to\\mathbb{R}$ be continuous. We will prove that $f$ is uniformly continuous.",
              "\\textbf{2. What must be shown?}\\\\ Given $\\varepsilon>0$, find a single $\\delta>0$ such that, for every $x,y\\in K$,\\[|x-y|<\\delta\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad |f(x)-f(y)|<\\varepsilon.\\]",
              "\\textbf{3. Start with continuity.}\\\\ Fix $\\varepsilon>0$. At each $a\\in K$, choose $r_a>0$ so that\\[x\\in K,\\ |x-a|<r_a\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad |f(x)-f(a)|<\\varepsilon/2.\\]",
              "\\textbf{4. Cover the domain.}\\\\ The intervals $B(a,r_a/2)$, for $a\\in K$, form an open cover of $K$.",
              "\\textbf{5. Use compactness.}\\\\ If $K$ is empty, the claim is immediate. Otherwise, select a finite subcover:\\[K\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i=1}^{N} B(a_i,r_{a_i}/2).\\] This is where compactness enters.",
              "\\textbf{6. Choose one distance.}\\\\ Set\\[\\delta=\\tfrac12\\min_{1\\le i\\le N}r_{a_i}>0.\\] A finite minimum of positive numbers stays positive.",
              "\\textbf{7. Choose an arbitrary pair.}\\\\ Take $x,y\\in K$ with $|x-y|<\\delta$. The subcover supplies an index $i$ with $|x-a_i|<r_{a_i}/2$.",
              "\\textbf{8. Both points are close to $a_i$.}\\\\ By the triangle inequality,\\[\\begin{aligned}|y-a_i|&\\le |y-x|+|x-a_i|\\\\ &<\\delta+r_{a_i}/2\\\\ &\\le r_{a_i}.\\end{aligned}\\]",
              "\\textbf{9. Compare the function values.}\\\\ Continuity at $a_i$ now gives\\[\\begin{aligned}|f(x)-f(y)|&\\le |f(x)-f(a_i)|\\\\ &\\quad+|f(a_i)-f(y)|\\\\ &<\\varepsilon/2+\\varepsilon/2=\\varepsilon.\\end{aligned}\\]",
              "\\textbf{10. Conclude.}\\\\ The chosen $\\delta$ depends on $\\varepsilon$, not on the pair $x,y$. Thus $f$ is uniformly continuous on $K$."
            ]
          },
          "label": "Proof paragraphs — edit here",
          "position": [
            0,
            0
          ],
          "collapsed": true,
          "chain": [],
          "config": [],
          "parent": null,
